        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although oil and natural gas production and related services account for a large majority of the activity in our Stateline Position, we anticipate there will be opportunities with developers seeking to build data centers, cryptocurrency mining facilities, power generation facilities, microgrids and power storage facilities and commercial fueling stations across our Stateline Position.",
        "start_character": 20031,
        "end_character": 20418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given our geographic concentration in the Permian Basin, we compete with existing landowners in the area to provide an attractive development site for the limited number of potential customers that seek to develop and/or construct infrastructure in Texas and New Mexico to support their various business activities.",
        "start_character": 67061,
        "end_character": 67376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Safety is important to us and begins with the protection and safety of the personnel who provide services with respect to our business and the communities in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 66107,
        "end_character": 66282
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The market in which we operate is competitive due to the location of our land in the Permian Basin in Texas and New Mexico and to the services in which we offer our customers.",
        "start_character": 66885,
        "end_character": 67060
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To the extent that any new final rule or rules issued by the EPA and Corps expands the scope of the CWA’s jurisdiction in areas where we or our customers conduct operations, such developments could increase compliance expenditures or mitigation costs, contribute to delays, restrictions, or cessation of the development of projects, and also reduce the rate of production of oil and natural gas from producers with whom we have a business relationship and, in turn, have a material adverse effect on our results of operations, cash flows and financial position.",
        "start_character": 83415,
        "end_character": 83976
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a diverse customer base consisting primarily of businesses that develop and produce oil and natural gas or provide services in support of oil and natural gas production.",
        "start_character": 37664,
        "end_character": 37841
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage our operations through a shared services agreement (the “Shared Services Agreement”) with certain affiliates of WaterBridge (the “Manager”).",
        "start_character": 63856,
        "end_character": 64006
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "1 In connection with the 1918 Ranch Acquisition, we issued 657,411 OpCo Units and a corresponding number of Class B shares to sellers.",
        "start_character": 102802,
        "end_character": 102936
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, there exist state and local jurisdictions in the United States where we operate that also have, or are developing or considering developing, similar environmental and occupational health and safety laws and regulations governing many of these same types of activities.",
        "start_character": 76553,
        "end_character": 76835
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although some of our competitors may have a broader geographic scope, longer operating history and greater financial and other resources than we have, we believe that we are competitively well-positioned due to the premier location of our land, which also provides a multitude of resources and uses, the reliability of our assets and our customer relationships, such as our symbiotic relationship with WaterBridge.",
        "start_character": 68168,
        "end_character": 68582
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to continuing to capitalize on existing agreements and relationships, we intend to pursue and acquire new commercial arrangements in an effort to develop and diversify our revenue streams.",
        "start_character": 58509,
        "end_character": 58709
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-072404",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-072404-862b6f97618ab3f8",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-072404",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe that the East Stateline Ranch contains substantial sand resources, which we expect to support additional sand mine developments over time and generate surface use revenue for us in connection with the utilization of our land.",
        "start_character": 19781,
        "end_character": 20030
      }
